# What a build is given. Without this, a build on a developer's machine would copy their
# node_modules (built for macOS) and their .env files, secrets included, into the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.docker.example
.git
.claude
**/storage
**/storage-test
backups
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
